    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "Oh... Another sunny day. I don't seem to remember any winters ever being so warm."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "How wonderful... As long as the wheat we're planting survives the winter and we don't hit a Catastrophe, we'll be self-sufficient next year!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_093#2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Worried Old Woman",
        "text": "It's a little too early to celebrate, after all I've been through..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_004",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "Come on, have a little optimism, Babushka! There was a time we thought we'd have nowhere to go, that we'd just die in the barrens! But now, we have our own farm, a house, and hot porridge\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "Huh? Who's over there...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "It's Miss Talulah! And Nine!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_hidehaystack",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_004"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "Miss Talulah, are you helping us pull the weeds?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Talulah, she's talking to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Oh\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Yes, that's right. Am I doing it wrong?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I saw everyone doing it this way, and the weeds here have grown pretty tall. So tall you can't see the wheat."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_004"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "No, no, you're doing it right. Pulling the weeds out will help make sure the wheat gets enough nutrients to survive the winter\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "You're such a quick learner!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Pff."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_004"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "You've already pulled so many, and you haven't hurt a single wheat bud! Looks like you don't need my help anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You taught us well. How's Iakov, by the way?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_004"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "The new medicine he's been taking is very effective, thanks to you! He used to writhe in pain until he fell out of bed at night, but no more."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Be sure to take care of yourself, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_004"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "I know. Honestly, this is already much better than what I was expecting, getting to keep him by my side."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Happy Peasant Woman",
        "text": "Thank you, both of you, and bless the Reunion Movement!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...No need to thank me."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
