    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "It's been two years, and you still feel uneasy when people show you their gratitude."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "I thought you'd have gotten used to it long ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Well, I'm not the one they should be thanking."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Sure enough. They are united under Reunion's banner, but they should actually be thanking themselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Not everyone has the courage and ability to rebuild their lives from the rubble."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I hope they'll realize that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "And you might want to realize how obvious it is when your mind is drifting away."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I was just wondering... when is Hui-chieh going to come back again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Don't tell me you're worried about her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Every time she's here, she brings back news."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Catastrophe Messengers avoid this disputed area, and normal ones won't so much as pass through. The information network we've spent two years building up is still far from comprehensive."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I'm waiting... waiting for Hui-chieh to bring something more real."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "What kind of news do you want to hear?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Anything... I want to know what's actually happening in Ursus right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "You don't believe what we saw in the west."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "What, you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "The upper class gave a little handout out of kindness, and that was enough to quell the anger for the most part, and enough to make those beset by injustice forget to think and resist."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "At the very least, we certainly did not receive any requests for help from the mining districts, whether from the west or even farther away."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Perhaps they just don't know of our existence, or they can't reach us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Besides, we still have yet to build a truly stable stronghold here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "But the people here haven't lost hope in us because of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "But they should, Nine."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah looks back in the direction where the sun is hanging high in the sky."
    },
    {
        "text": "She stares into its light, until her eyes start to hurt."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
