            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "Nine, the new suppressant pipeline's finished. Should we put it to use right away?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "Valiya."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "Yeah?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "If I were to tell you we're abandoning this place and heading to Deity Grypherburg, what would you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "Hah! Of course I'm coming with you. Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "What about the others?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "Them too. We knew all along that Reunion wasn't going to stop here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "But I don't think all of us should go. Everyone's been doing different things here for a while. Those of us who can fight should go with you, but the rest can still stay here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter",
        "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Nine, it's just as he said... I think perhaps we're ready now\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We're ready to face the hideous truth hiding behind all that's bright and colorful. After they've long taken root and proliferated, they can't all be pulled at once..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "In such a case, we can only keep pulling away. A second time, and a third time... for as long as we live, until someone finally succeeds."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Now that we know who we must bring together, the time may have come to break these shackles, and we should do it without hesitation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Uniting all those who can unite, and breaking all chains that should never have chained us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We need only a single opportunity."
    },
