        "text": "Talulah. Nine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Red",
        "text": "It's urgent."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "What is it, Red? It's not like you to look so nervous."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_328_1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Red",
        "text": "I ran into a group of refugees near the village. They said they're miners who escaped the Far North, and they're here cause they've heard tell of Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Red",
        "text": "I checked them over. They're unarmed, and they're all Infected. I had them wait at the sentry post. We need you to decide what to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "From the Far North? We haven't heard much from there. What do you mean, they 'escaped?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_328_1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Red",
        "text": "Yeah, not much intel ever leaks out of there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Red",
        "text": "As for what happened... maybe it's better you hear it from them."
    },
